title: Registrar and HRMP migration wire types

doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |
      Adds the types the migrator pallet needs to manage parachain registrations and HRMP channels
      migration over to the pallets that will own them on a system chain (Coretime).

      `registrar-primitives`
      - `MigratedPara` & `MigratedParaState`: the data that migrates from RC to CT.
      - Trait `ReceiveMigratedParas` that should be implemented by `registrar_para`.

      `hrmp-primitives`
      - `MigratedChannel` and `ChannelId`: the data that migrates from RC to CT.
      - `ReceiveMigratedChannels`: trait to be implemented by `hrmp_para`.

crates:
  - name: registrar-primitives
    bump: minor
  - name: hrmp-primitives
    bump: minor
